Optional Giac backend
---------------------

The crate crates/geo-giac can, when built with its `giac` feature, load the
Giac computer algebra system (https://www-fourier.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/~parisse/giac.html)
at run time. Giac is Copyright (C) Bernard Parisse and Renee De Graeve,
Institut Fourier, and is licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later.

No Giac source or binary is part of this repository, and builds without the
`giac` feature contain no Giac code. A program built with the feature and
distributed together with a Giac library is a combined work that must be
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later; the
EUPL 1.2 lists that licence as compatible. See docs/cas-giac.md.

